# Reports — generated files
# (reports/charts/ sengaja TIDAK di-ignore: PNG-nya di-commit untuk README)
# reports/results/ sebelumnya di-ignore (artefak harus di-commit agar bisa diverifikasi ulang)
# Namun kita commit summary/faithfulness/consistency; log berat tetap di-ignore
reports/results/*
!reports/results/README.txt
reports/report.html

# Checkpoints — resume state, tidak di-commit
logs/checkpoints/
